        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "PASS WHEN · For each block you can name the trade-off — which reads fastest as \"this expands\", which best avoids competing with real content — and confirm that collapsing an already-open hover-reveal row never depends on hovering it first."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
